<title>UK: A.M. Best awards Zurich Re's UK unit A-.</title>
<headline>A.M. Best awards Zurich Re's UK unit A-.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zurich Re (UK) Ltd, a part of Zurich Insurance Group, said ratings agency A.M. Best had awarded it an initial A- rating.</p>
<p>A statement from Zurich Re said A.M. Best said the rating reflected the company's &quot;excellent financial strength, parental commitment and financial support, strengthened loss reserve, membership in Zurich Insurance Group and leading positions in its core lines of business&quot;.</p>
<p>The A- rating carries a stable outlook, the statement said.</p>
<p>Zurich Re (UK) had net premium of 358 million stg in 1995 and gross assets of 1.143 billion stg.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Insurance News 44 171 542 2769</p>
</text>
